            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A cooking appliance includes a main body including a cooking chamber (12), a steam generator (30) including a steam heater (31) for generating steam for heating food contained in the cooking chamber (12), a lower heater (22) located below a bottom wall of the cooking chamber and configured to generate heat to heat the food, and a controller (41) configured to control the steam heater (31) and the lower heater (22). The controller (30 operates the steam heater to generate steam when a steam cooking mode is selected, and turns the lower heater on while steam cooking is performed.</p>
